# PM Core Architecture

## Layers

- `app.py` — entry only (page config, layout, delegate to `pm_app/ui`)
- `pm_app/` — Streamlit app layer + `run_pm_analysis()` pipeline
- `src/` — pure engine (no Streamlit imports)

## Rules

1. Business logic → `pm_app/pipeline.py` or `src/`, never bloated `app.py`
2. No root `patch_*.py` / `fix_*.py` — edit source files; archive is `tools/archive/`
3. No debug `print()` in mesh/analysis loops
4. Read `docs/sign-conventions.md` before changing N/M/strain handling
5. Large changes: add/update `tests/golden/*.yaml` first or alongside
6. UI labels stay Korean unless user requests otherwise

## Key entry points

- Analysis: `pm_app.pipeline.run_pm_analysis(AnalysisInputs)`
- Inputs model: `pm_app.models.AnalysisInputs`
- Codes: `src.codes.CODES`

See `AGENTS.md` for full map.
